---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import PageIntro from '../../components/PageIntro.astro';
import PoolSpec from '../../components/PoolSpec.astro';
import BookSection from '../../components/BookSection.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import poolNight from '../../assets/pool-night.jpg';
import poolDay from '../../assets/pool-day.jpg';
import room from '../../assets/treatment-room.jpg';
import { approach } from '../../data/content';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<Base title="Aquatic, land and WATSU physiotherapy, Dover Heights | CK" description="One-on-one aquatic physiotherapy in a private 33 to 34 degree salt water pool, hands-on land-based physiotherapy and WATSU in Dover Heights. No need to swim.">
  <Header slot="header" />
  <PageIntro label="Treatments" title="Aquatic physiotherapy, land-based physiotherapy and WATSU, one on one" lead="Broader treatment options. Better individualised care. We combine water and land therapy for your specific needs after assessment." />

  <nav aria-label="On this page" class="bg-white border-b border-panel">
    <ul class="wrap py-3 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-1 text-[15px] font-bold text-primary">
      <li><a href="#aquatic" class="inline-block py-2 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Aquatic physiotherapy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#land" class="inline-block py-2 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Land-based physiotherapy</a></li>
      <li><a href="#watsu" class="inline-block py-2 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">WATSU</a></li>
      <li><a href="#programs" class="inline-block py-2 underline-offset-4 hover:underline">Rehabilitation programs</a></li>
    </ul>
  </nav>

  <!-- Aquatic -->
  <section id="aquatic" class="wrap py-10 md:py-20 scroll-mt-20 grid gap-8 md:gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
    <Picture src={poolNight} alt="The therapy pool at night with the underwater light on and the white perimeter fencing" widths={[640, 1000, 1600]} sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} class="w-full rounded-xl object-cover aspect-[3/2]" />
    <div>
      <p class="label">Aquatic physiotherapy</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl">One-on-one aquatic physiotherapy in a private, heated salt water pool</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 font-semibold text-ink">You do not need to know how to swim to have aquatic physiotherapy. The physiotherapist is in the water at all times with the client.</p>
      <p class="mt-4">Aquatic physiotherapy utilises the natural buoyancy and warmth of a 33 to 34 degree pool to eliminate gravity stress on painful joints, allowing patients to safely rebuild strength and mobility much sooner than on land. The water's gentle resistance also accelerates post-surgical healing and reduces swelling, making it an ideal, low-impact environment for pain relief and physical rehabilitation.</p>
      <p class="mt-4">By eliminating gravity, we enable movement that is otherwise impossible on land. Aquatic therapy utilises hydrostatic pressure to reduce swelling and improve circulation, providing a weightless environment where healing begins with every gentle pulse of the water.</p>
      <p class="mt-4">Having completed aquatic orthopaedic and neurological courses, and many more, Coryn is able to treat most conditions effectively in the water. We have loads of fun equipment to create resistance to help challenge you to improve your muscle strength and cardiovascular fitness and endurance.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white border-y border-panel">
    <div class="wrap py-10 md:py-20">
      <p class="label">About our facility</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl max-w-3xl">Therapeutic depth, therapeutic temperature, railing everywhere</h2>
      <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 md:gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr]">
        <div>
          <p>Our indoor salt water therapy pool is therapeutic depth (1.1 to 1.3 m deep). There is a change room inside the pool area, and toilet facilities in the clinic within metres. The pool has dual railing to enter, and there is railing throughout the perimeter of the pool as well as the physiotherapy practice to ensure client safety.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">The temperature of the water is 33 to 34 degrees Celsius year round. During winter we have a heater at the pool for your comfort. Parking is highly convenient and always available directly outside the clinic.</p>
          <p class="mt-4">We have unique aquatic equipment from America, South Africa, the UK, Israel and Australia to assist in improving balance and proprioception, muscle strength and endurance.</p>
          <PoolSpec class="mt-8" />
        </div>
        <Picture src={poolDay} alt="The pool by day: the tiled entry steps with dual stainless steel handrails, the perimeter railing and equipment at the edge" widths={[592]} sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} class="w-full max-w-[592px] rounded-xl object-cover aspect-[4/5] lg:max-w-none lg:aspect-auto lg:h-full" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Land -->
  <section id="land" class="wrap py-10 md:py-20 scroll-mt-20 grid gap-8 md:gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-center">
    <div class="lg:order-2">
      <p class="label">Land-based physiotherapy</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl">Hands-on manual therapy and evidence-based practice in the clinic</h2>
      <p class="mt-4">At CK Physiotherapy, our land-based treatment combines a patient-centred approach, hands-on manual therapy and evidence-based practice to help you achieve your recovery goals. We tailor every treatment plan to your unique lifestyle and needs, using proven, research-backed techniques to ensure your care is both safe and effective.</p>
      <p class="mt-4">By integrating skilled, hands-on joint and soft tissue mobilisation with the latest scientific clinical data, we focus on reducing your pain, restoring your mobility, and supporting your long-term physical wellbeing.</p>
      <p class="mt-4">Coryn has completed advanced dry needling courses, as well as a kinesiology taping course. She has a special interest in helping people who suffer from both chronic and acute pain.</p>
      <p class="mt-5"><a href={`${base}/conditions/`} class="font-bold text-primary underline underline-offset-4">Conditions we treat</a></p>
    </div>
    <Picture src={room} alt="The treatment room at CK Physiotherapy with a navy treatment bed, desk and a window looking onto the pool" widths={[480, 640]} sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} class="w-full max-w-[640px] rounded-xl object-cover aspect-[4/3] lg:order-1" />
  </section>

  <!-- WATSU summary -->
  <section id="watsu" class="relative bg-ink text-white scroll-mt-20">
    <Picture src={poolNight} alt="The lit water of the therapy pool at night" widths={[768, 1600]} sizes="100vw" formats={['avif', 'webp']} class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[50%_80%] opacity-40" pictureAttributes={{ class: 'absolute inset-0' }} />
    <div class="relative wrap py-10 md:py-20 max-w-3xl">
      <p class="font-bold text-tint">WATSU</p>
      <h2 class="mt-2 text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl">WATSU sessions are also offered at our practice</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/90 text-lg">WATSU (WATer ShiatsU) is a gentle form of aquatic bodywork performed in 34 degree Celsius water. A certified practitioner guides you through slow, flowing movements, stretches, and rotations while you are uniquely supported by the buoyancy of the water, creating deep relaxation and relief from joint loading.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-white/90">Coryn is the only WATSU certified physiotherapist in Sydney, NSW.</p>
      <a href={`${base}/watsu/`} class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-md bg-white text-ink px-5 py-3 font-bold min-h-[44px] items-center">About WATSU, benefits and who it helps</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Programs + approach -->
  <section id="programs" class="wrap py-10 md:py-20 scroll-mt-20">
    <p class="label">Personalised rehabilitation programs</p>
    <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl md:text-4xl max-w-3xl">Water and land therapy combined for your specific needs</h2>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl">Our comprehensive assessments allow for customised care for neuro-musculoskeletal conditions, balance difficulties and complex pain conditions. We create tailored programs based on assessment findings and combine water and land therapy for your specific needs.</p>
    <h3 class="mt-10 text-2xl">My approach: strongly hands on and client-centred</h3>
    <div class="mt-6 grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-x-12 gap-y-6 md:gap-y-8">
      {approach.map((a) => (
        <div class="border-t-2 border-primary pt-4">
          <h4 class="text-xl">{a.name}</h4>
          <p class="mt-2">{a.text}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <BookSection heading="Ready to start moving?" />
  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Base>
